OL,3,AUS designates Palestine Action a
OL,4,Aterrorist group
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has imposed sanctions on
OL,7,FPalestine Action, designating it as a
OL,8,Fterrorist group.
OL,10,FThe US Department of the Treasury said
OL,11,Fit had "taken action" against the
OL,12,FUK-based group, which it accused of
OL,13,Fsupporting "numerous acts of terrorism
OL,14,Fsince July 2020".
OL,16,FSupporting Palestine Action became
OL,17,Fillegal in the UK in 2025 after the
OL,18,Fgovernment banned it under anti-terror
OL,19,Flegislation.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
