OL,3,AUS designates Palestine Action a
OL,4,Aterrorist group
OL,5,
OL,6,FPalestine Action co-founder Huda Ammori
OL,7,Fresponded in a social media post,
OL,8,Fsaying: "As a Palestinian and Iraqi,
OL,9,Fthe fact the country which destroyed
OL,10,Fboth my homelands is calling me a
OL,11,Fterrorist, is beyond hypocritical."
